 know. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But do you even know where to find your commander? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Your commander is right in the forefront so all relevant intel has been made confidential by the Military. You won't find out much with your current authorization."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is an area under Griffin jurisdiction. I'll find a way."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It used to be. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're a little bird that just broke free of its cage, charging blindly ahead. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You see that cloud of smoke right there? Another support troop freshly destroyed by Sangvis Ferri. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is a real battlefield. One or two of those Vespids and Jaegers, or even just a few Dinergates can be the end of you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then why have you brought me in here?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Someone is paying me to help you, even if you're trying to get yourself killed."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Persica?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Clever girl."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But she never mentioned you to me. Who exactly are you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Angie studies M4A1 intently."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm just your common mercenary working for money. Nothing special about me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So...that ID is forged?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"To be fair, the Military has some tight security, but I AM an expert in the field. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't worry. I really am here to help you in my own way... Any other questions?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4A1 ponders in silence."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please tell me what I should do."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hmm?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You said Miss Persica sent you to assist me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm...not entirely sure how to proceed..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So you just barged into a military control zone alone without even a plan?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All I want is to return to my team...to my friends...and make Mastermind pay for everything she did. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I don't know how to do that... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Maybe something's wrong with me. This makes no sense..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You want to be stronger, but it isn't really who you are. That's why it's a bit too difficult for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There's a little outpost just ahead. Wait there."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Your commander will come for you. Trust me. I'll make sure of that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Will you...really do that?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yep. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't really want to go about it like this, but I'll make you strong again."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Again?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The fact that you're here proves that you've already chosen your path. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And since you've made your choice, the solution should be obvious."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But the solution isn't presented as an order, so I can't judge whether it's the correct course of action..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's how T-Dolls are designed, but you're different – you're special. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Making choices entails suffering, because you have to suffer the consequences of the choices you make. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But this is the only way to become stronger, and the only way for you to choose your own destiny."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My own destiny..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Didn't you go through all that training for this very day, M4A1 of the AR Team?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Angelia gives her a wave and walks away."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"安洁莉娅","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You've changed since then... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Keep changing. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"(Only then can you become our only hope...in stopping them from getting what they want...)"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"8","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Sunshine","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Meanwhile, at the Griffin outpost in Area S11."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, all our supplies have arrived safely at the base! All that's left is for the Military to give the green light! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? I'm being too loud? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sorry about that, but I just can't helped being a bit worked up over an operation of this scale! Even you yourself are nervous! How often do you get up so early in the morning? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...You're right. Who could stay calm after receiving such an order? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"At last...we'll be having a final showdown with Sangvis Ferri's Mastermind. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We've been exchanging fire for so long, but now that the moment is finally here, I'm actually a bit flustered. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Not to mention, this is the first time Griffin is working with the Military in a joint operation. I wonder if it'll go smoothly... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Huh? I talk too much? Commander! How could you say that to your adjutant?! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In any case, there's no point in thinking about it. Just follow the Military's orders and it'll be fine! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Feel free to go all out on the front, Commander! I'll give you the best support you can ever dream of!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The control room receives a transmission request."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Here it is! Our orders from the Military!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Click."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Helian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Kalin, so you're here too. Perfect."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh... It's just Miss Helian..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Helian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's with that disappointment...? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, your echelons have reached the combat zone, but the other commanders are still on their way, so I'm giving you an important assignment."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oooh! We're really going all out this time!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"Helian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Five minutes ago, Sangvis Ferri ambushed multiple Griffin outposts and disrupted our supply lines. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The outposts in question are marked on the map. I need you to eliminate the Sangvis forces there to ensure safe passage for our supplies."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"10","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_War","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点2"}],"speaker":"Kalin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The forces in the Sangvis base in this area?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Helian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Precisely. This operation is of critical importance. Absolutely nothing can go wrong, especially since we are deep within Sangvis territory. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So I'm leaving it to you, is that alright? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Good, Commander. We can always count on you. Good luck."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Helian","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"Kalin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A little warm-up before the big battle? Let's go then, Commander!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
